<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HomeConnect — Connexion & Inscription</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --wine:       #7B1D2E;
            --wine-dark:  #5A1020;
            --wine-mid:   #9B2D3E;
            --wine-light: #C04B5F;
            --wine-pale:  #F9EDF0;
            --wine-mist:  #F2D8DD;
            --black:      #141414;
            --gray-dark:  #3A3A3A;
            --gray-mid:   #6B6B6B;
            --gray-line:  #E8E2E3;
            --gray-bg:    #F6F4F4;
            --white:      #FFFFFF;
            --success:    #059669;
            --error:      #DC2626;
        }

        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background: var(--gray-bg);
            color: var(--black);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           TOP BAR
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .topbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            height: 64px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-line);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 5%;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            width: 38px; height: 38px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wine), var(--wine-light));
            border-radius: 9px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            color: #fff; font-size: 0.95rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(123,29,46,0.3);
        }

        .logo-name {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--black);
        }

        .logo-name span { color: var(--wine); }

        .back-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.25s;
        }

        .back-link:hover { color: var(--wine); }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           MAIN LAYOUT
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .auth-wrapper {
            flex: 1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding-top: 64px;
        }

        /* ── LEFT PANEL ── */
        .auth-left {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--wine-dark) 0%, var(--wine) 60%, var(--wine-mid) 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 4rem 5%;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* decorative circles */
        .auth-left::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -120px; left: -120px;
            width: 400px; height: 400px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .auth-left::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -140px; right: -100px;
            width: 450px; height: 450px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* dot grid */
        .auth-left-dots {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 28px 28px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .auth-left-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 420px;
        }

        .left-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 100px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        .left-dot {
            width: 7px; height: 7px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: blink 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.3;} }

        .auth-left h2 {
            font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .auth-left p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        /* trust points */
        .trust-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.1rem;
        }

        .trust-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.9rem;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
        }

        .trust-ico {
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-radius: 9px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #fff;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* stat cards row */
        .left-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .left-stat {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
        }

        .left-stat-num {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .left-stat-label {
            font-size: 0.74rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
        }

        /* ── RIGHT PANEL ── */
        .auth-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 3rem 5%;
            background: var(--white);
        }

        .auth-box {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 460px;
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           TABS
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .auth-tabs {
            display: flex;
            background: var(--gray-bg);
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-line);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            background: var(--wine);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(123,29,46,0.28);
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           PANELS
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .auth-panel { display: none; }
        .auth-panel.active { display: block; }

        .auth-panel-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--black);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .auth-panel-sub {
            font-size: 0.87rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           ROLE SELECTOR
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .role-selector {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .role-card {
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-line);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .role-card input[type="radio"] {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0;
            width: 0; height: 0;
        }

        .role-card:hover { border-color: var(--wine-light); background: var(--wine-pale); }

        .role-card.selected {
            border-color: var(--wine);
            background: var(--wine-pale);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(123,29,46,0.08);
        }

        .role-card.selected .role-check { display: flex; }

        .role-icon {
            width: 44px; height: 44px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--wine-pale);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--wine);
            margin: 0 auto 0.7rem;
            transition: background 0.25s, color 0.25s;
        }

        .role-card.selected .role-icon { background: var(--wine); color: #fff; }

        .role-name {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--black);
        }

        .role-sub {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            margin-top: 0.2rem;
        }

        .role-check {
            display: none;
            position: absolute;
            top: 8px; right: 8px;
            width: 18px; height: 18px;
            background: var(--wine);
            border-radius: 50%;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           FORM
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
        }

        .form-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gray-dark);
            margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        }

        .form-label i { color: var(--wine); font-size: 0.75rem; }

        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            padding-left: 2.6rem;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-line);
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--black);
            background: var(--white);
            transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--wine);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(123,29,46,0.08);
        }

        .form-control::placeholder { color: var(--gray-light); }

        .form-control.error { border-color: var(--error); }
        .form-control.error:focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(220,38,38,0.08); }

        .input-wrap {
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0.85rem;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--gray-light);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: color 0.25s;
        }

        .input-wrap:focus-within .input-icon { color: var(--wine); }

        .input-toggle {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0.85rem;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--gray-light);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.25s;
            padding: 0.2rem;
        }

        .input-toggle:hover { color: var(--wine); }

        .form-hint {
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
        }

        .form-error {
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            color: var(--error);
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
            display: none;
        }

        .form-error.show { display: block; }

        /* password strength */
        .pw-strength {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .pw-bars {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .pw-bar {
            flex: 1;
            height: 3px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: var(--gray-line);
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .pw-bar.weak { background: #EF4444; }
        .pw-bar.medium { background: #F59E0B; }
        .pw-bar.strong { background: var(--success); }

        .pw-label {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
        }

        /* checkbox */
        .form-check {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
        }

        .custom-check {
            width: 18px; height: 18px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-line);
            border-radius: 5px;
            appearance: none;
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 1px;
            transition: border-color 0.25s, background 0.25s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .custom-check:checked {
            background: var(--wine);
            border-color: var(--wine);
        }

        .custom-check:checked::after {
            content: '\f00c';
            font-family: 'Font Awesome 6 Free';
            font-weight: 900;
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%; left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            font-size: 0.62rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .check-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .check-label a { color: var(--wine); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
        .check-label a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        /* submit */
        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.95rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wine), var(--wine-mid));
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(123,29,46,0.28);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(123,29,46,0.36); }
        .btn-submit:active { transform: translateY(0); }

        /* divider */
        .auth-divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .auth-divider::before, .auth-divider::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--gray-line);
        }

        .auth-divider span {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* social buttons */
        .social-btns {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .social-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            padding: 0.7rem;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-line);
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.83rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gray-dark);
            background: var(--white);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: border-color 0.25s, background 0.25s;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .social-btn:hover { border-color: var(--gray-dark); background: var(--gray-bg); }

        /* forgot */
        .forgot-link {
            float: right;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--wine);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .forgot-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        /* switch text */
        .auth-switch {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.83rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .auth-switch a {
            color: var(--wine);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .auth-switch a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        /* flash messages */
        .flash-msg {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .flash-success { background: #ECFDF5; color: #065F46; border: 1px solid #A7F3D0; }
        .flash-error   { background: #FEF2F2; color: #991B1B; border: 1px solid #FECACA; }
        .flash-info    { background: var(--wine-pale); color: var(--wine-dark); border: 1px solid var(--wine-mist); }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           FORGOT PASSWORD OVERLAY
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .forgot-panel {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeUp 0.3s ease both;
        }

        .forgot-panel.active { display: block; }

        .back-to-login {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--wine);
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: none;
            background: none;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            transition: gap 0.2s;
        }

        .back-to-login:hover { gap: 0.7rem; }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           STEP INDICATOR (register)
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .steps-indicator {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .step-dot {
            width: 28px; height: 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--gray-bg);
            border: 2px solid var(--gray-line);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .step-dot.active { background: var(--wine); border-color: var(--wine); color: #fff; }
        .step-dot.done { background: var(--success); border-color: var(--success); color: #fff; }

        .step-line {
            flex: 1;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--gray-line);
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .step-line.done { background: var(--success); }

        .step-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
        }

        .step-wrap {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           VERIFICATION CODE
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        .code-inputs {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .code-input {
            width: 52px; height: 60px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-line);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--wine);
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--white);
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
        }

        .code-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--wine);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(123,29,46,0.1);
        }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           ANIMATIONS
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .auth-box { animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both; }

        /* ══════════════════════════════
           RESPONSIVE
        ══════════════════════════════ */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .auth-wrapper { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .auth-left { display: none; }
            .auth-right { padding: 2rem 5%; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .social-btns { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .role-selector { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

{# ══════════════════════════════
   TOP BAR
══════════════════════════════ #}
<header class="topbar">
    <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="logo">
        <div class="logo-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney"></i></div>
        <span class="logo-name">Immo<span>Sécure</span></span>
    </a>
    <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="back-link">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left fa-xs"></i> Retour à l'accueil
    </a>
</header>


{# ══════════════════════════════
   MAIN
══════════════════════════════ #}
<div class="auth-wrapper">

    {# ── LEFT PANEL ── #}
    <div class="auth-left">
        <div class="auth-left-dots"></div>
        <div class="auth-left-content">

            <div class="left-badge">
                <div class="left-dot"></div>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved fa-xs"></i>
                Plateforme certifiée — Bénin
            </div>

            <h2>La location immobilière<br>réinventée au Bénin</h2>

            <p>Rejoignez des milliers de propriétaires et locataires béninois sur la première plateforme 100&nbsp;% digitalisée, sécurisée et adaptée au contexte local.</p>

            <ul class="trust-list">
                <li>
                    <div class="trust-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card-clip fa-xs"></i></div>
                    Vérification d'identité (KYC) complète
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="trust-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract fa-xs"></i></div>
                    Contrats numériques selon la loi béninoise
                </li>
                <li>
